      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <span>© 2026 by Creator Essentials &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="/privacy-policy/" style="color:inherit; text-decoration:underline;">Privacy Policy</a></span>
        <span>Tools, tips, and resources for serious YouTubers.</span>
